5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Hi everyone! I'm looking forward to our trip. To make sure we pick the best spot, we should be thorough. Let's start by deciding what information we need to gather to make a logical choice.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is so lovely to see everyone! I agree, Mizuki. I want us to choose a place where we can all feel relaxed and truly enjoy each other's company. I look forward to hearing your ideas.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I'm excited too! I wonder what kind of places we can find. I want to know about the things that make a place feel cozy and easy to stay in. What should we check first?,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a pleasure to be with you all. I believe it would be wise to understand the logistics of the journey first, so we can ensure the trip remains peaceful and doesn't become too exhausting.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,It's nice to meet you all! I agree that harmony is important. I'd like to make sure we have a clear picture of the total costs so that everyone feels comfortable with the budget.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Midori and Jonathan. We need a balance of budget and logistics. I'll look into ""Time alone in the shared-house year"" and ""How last year's days ran"" to understand our group dynamics better.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds like a wonderful start, Mizuki. I believe it is also important to know how we will be resting and eating together. I will look into ""Bathing hours and bathroom provision"" and ""Inn mealtimes and room arrangements.""","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I want to know more about the rooms and the bathrooms too! I'll check ""Bathing hours and bathroom provision"" and ""Inn mealtimes and room arrangements"" so I can see how we'll spend our time.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I will look into ""Ferry sailings and train time"" and ""Getting around by train and bus."" I want to see how much of our time is spent in transit and waiting.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I want to be sure about the final expenses. I'll look into ""All-in rates against meals bought separately"" and ""Pricing of offshore houses let whole"" to see the total costs upfront.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we've covered the logistics, budget, and rooming, I think we have a comprehensive plan. I'm interested to see if last year's schedule contributed to how we felt during the trip. Does anyone else feel we've missed anything?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I believe we have a very thoughtful plan. I am simply hoping that whatever we find will lead us to a place where everyone feels welcome and at ease. It is the heart of the trip that matters most.,"{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,"I think it's a great plan! I'm curious if the prices for different kinds of beds are very different. Maybe someone else wants to check the ""Valley inn rates versus urban beds"" or the ""What separately booked rooms cost last time""?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I think we have a sufficient amount of data to start with. I am content to wait and see what the transport schedules reveal about our travel time. I believe the current plan is quite balanced.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Minato, that's a good point! However, I think we have enough covered for now. I'm looking forward to seeing if the all-in rates make things simpler for us. Let's see what we find!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree. We have a solid distribution of research across budget, logistics, and living arrangements. Let's proceed with our investigations and reconvene to share our findings. I'll see you all in the next round.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
