22,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I agree. Let us all take a moment to look into these things carefully. I hope the information we find helps us create a warm and inclusive atmosphere for everyone. See you all soon.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
