24,1,4,talk,Minato,,I'll go look into those things now! I hope we find a place that's really cozy for everyone. I can't wait to see what we discover! See you all soon!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
