26,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I shall begin my research now. I hope the data allows us to find a path that is as seamless and quiet as possible. I look forward to seeing you all again soon.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
